    "bodyText": "Consent\nDetails\nAbout\nThis website uses cookies\n\nWe use cookies to personalize content and ads, run social media features, and analyze traffic. We also share your site usage data with our analytics, social, and advertising partners.\n\nAllow all\nHome\n \nAbout Us\n \nServices\n \nGallery\n \nBlog\n \nContact\nCALL NOW \nCALL NOW \nCUSTOM SHEET METAL\nFABRICATION SHOP\n\nHVAC Ductwork Welding and Custom Fabrication Bending and Shering\nMANUFACTURING PROTOTYING\n\nDISCOVER MORE \nDISCOVER MORE \nDUCTWORK SYSTEMS\nCUSTOM HVAC SOLUTIONS\n\nGalvanized Steel Ducts Fittings Airflow Optimization and Easy Installation\n\nDISCOVER MORE \nDISCOVER MORE \nCustom HVAC Sheet Metal Fabrication & Ductwork Manufacturing In NJ\n\nHVAC Metals LLC is a specialized B2B custom sheet metal fabrication shop located in Kearny, New Jersey, providing wholesale HVAC ductwork and contractor supplies across NJ, NY, and PA. We manufacture precision rectangular, spiral, and oval ductwork, along with custom HVAC curbs, curb adapters, and equipment rails. Utilizing high-quality galvanized steel, stainless steel, and aluminum, our facility leverages advanced welding, panel bending, and precision laser cutting to deliver exact shop drawings and durable commercial HVAC components.\n\nWHO WE ARE\nPanel Bending Kearny, New Jersey\n\nIs our new state of the art panel bending machine was just added to our lineup. The innovative design, streamlines downstream processes, reducing production time and increasing efficiency and mass production accuracy\n\nHVAC Metals, LLC\n\nFounded in 2015, HVAC Metals, LLC is a family-owned and family-operated shop guided by quality, integrity, and pride. We provide custom-made products for HVAC contractors across New Jersey, with galvanized steel as our go-to material thanks to its durability, corrosion resistance, and reliable airflow performance in the state’s humid and unpredictable climate.\n\nOUR SERVICES\nWe Offer Effective Solutions\nSheet Metal Fabrication\nCustom Sheet Metal Fabrication is the process of cutting\nLEARN MORE \nLEARN MORE \nDuctwork & Custom\nCustom Sheet Metal Fabrication is the process of cutting\nLEARN MORE \nLEARN MORE \nSheet Metal Trends\nCustom Sheet Metal Fabrication is the process of cutting\nLEARN MORE \nLEARN MORE \nCUSTOM DUCTWORK & METAL FABRICATION\nHVAC Ductwork\n\nHVAC METALS builds rectangular, round, and oval ductwork in both single- and double-wall designs, using galvanized steel, stainless steel, copper, aluminum, PCD, and galvanneal. Our duct systems are made for long-lasting performance, tight air seals, and full compliance with New Jersey HVAC codes. While many contractors choose aluminum for lighter installs or flexible duct for tight areas, galvanized steel continues to be the strongest and most dependable choice for residential and commercial projects.\n\nWelding and Custom Fabrication\nBending and Shearing\nEstimates and Shop Drawings\nPresision Laser Cutting\nOUR BLOG\nLatest News\nVIEW ALL POST\nVIEW ALL POST\n18 OCT\nWarehouse Destratification Duct Layout | Hudson County NJ\nREAD MORE ABOUT WAREHOUSE DESTRATIFICATION DUCT LAYOUT | HUDSON COUNTY NJ\nREAD MORE\n18 OCT\nHospital Isolation Monitor Enclosures | Hudson NJ\nREAD MORE ABOUT HOSPITAL ISOLATION MONITOR ENCLOSURES | HUDSON NJ\nREAD MORE\n18 OCT\n316L Salt-Air Duct Fabrication | Hudson County NJ\nREAD MORE ABOUT 316L SALT-AIR DUCT FABRICATION | HUDSON COUNTY NJ\nREAD MORE\nCONTACT US\nLet’s Work Together\n\nWe’d love to share more with you, please complete this form and\nour dedicated team will get back to you shortly.\n\nFields marked with an * are required\nFabrication for HVAC and custom work\nHVAC METALS\nHome\nAbout Us\nGallery\nBlog\nContact\nSERVICES\nSheet Metal Trends\nDuctwork & Custom\nSheet Metal Fabrication\nCONTACT\n183 Garfield Avenue Kearny, NJ 07032\n(201) 991-2206\nart@hvacllc.com\n© 2026 HVAC Metals Developed By OpenFS LLC\nCall Us Now\n\n(201) 991-2206",
